00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:44,280
Okay, so the first word has to do with the eyes.

114
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,800
We just talked about the eyebrows.

115
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,040
Those are above your eyes.

116
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:51,440
Well, what happens if your eyes are very, very deep in your face?

117
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:54,000
Okay, we heard that in the dialogue.

118
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:58,940
We heard that in the dialogue described as sunken eyes.

119
00:06:00,090 --> 00:06:04,470
So sunken means very far back or very deep in something.

120
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:07,070
Think about a sunken ship.

121
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,990
It's under the water, under the ocean.

122
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:15,630
So someone with sunken eyes probably has dark rings under their eyes because their eyes are so deep in their head.

123
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:16,390
That's right.

124
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:21,320
And the opposite, maybe you've seen people that have eyes that are almost like popping out a little bit.

125
00:06:21,330 --> 00:06:21,450
Right.

126
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:22,810
His eyes pop out.

127
00:06:23,010 --> 00:06:24,430
That means they come out of the face.

128
00:06:24,650 --> 00:06:26,090
They're closer to the skin.

129
00:06:26,330 --> 00:06:26,790
That's right.

130
